<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RBA appoints new economic research head.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RBA appoints new economic research head.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said on Tuesday it has appointed Philip Lowe as the head of its Economic Research Department.</p>
<p>Lowe joined the RBA in 1980 and has been a chief economist in the central bank's economic analysis department since 1995.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
